				<wikidot:authorName>TL333s</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1304786</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Why are there no tales about 507? He's one of the very first articles I ever read and I have always loved him.</p> <p>Realistically speaking, I'm not sure about him being Broken God devotee, or his arch-nemesis being 343. I mean, both of these things come out of left field, along with him being able to control, or at least activate, his powers.</p> <p>Awesomely speaking, watching 507 piss 343 off was almost as amazing as the Able/682 rap battle. And that is why I upvoted.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
